      "beat_id": "BIDEA",
      "act": "THE IDEA",
      "lane": "IDEA",
      "narration_text": "Here's the idea of this film. A hook isn't magic. It's a shell command Claude Code runs at a lifecycle moment — after a Write, before a Bash, at the start of a session. Wire the shape right and it fires every time. The interesting part isn't the script. The interesting part is which two lines Claude can draft, and which two lines only you can sign.",
      "estimated_duration_s": 24.0,
      "voice": "am_onyx",
      "engine": "kokoro",
