      "beat_id": "B06",
      "act": "THE HONEST LIMIT",
      "lane": "TERMINAL",
      "narration_text": "One honest thing. PostToolUse fires after. The Edit was already on disk before my script started. The exit code cannot rescind the write. If I want a wall — refuse the tool call, hand Claude the reason — that's PreToolUse and exit two. Same shape, different event. This hook is a receipt. Not a wall.",
